2
00:00:06,513 --> 00:00:08,813
(Sheldon:)Hello.
Oh!

3
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,890
(Amy:)What are you doing here?

4
00:00:10,955 --> 00:00:14,255
(Sheldon:)When last we spoke,
you said you needed time.

5
00:00:14,325 --> 00:00:17,695
(Amy:)Well, it's only been 11 hours.

6
00:00:17,761 --> 00:00:20,331
The Lord of the Rings trilogy
was nearly 11 hours.

7
00:00:20,397 --> 00:00:22,867
(Sheldon:)I made you watch that,
you said it was an eternity.

8
00:00:22,933 --> 00:00:27,133
(Amy:)Sheldon, when I'm ready to talk,
I'll let you know.

9
00:00:27,204 --> 00:00:28,604
(Sheldon:)Very well.

10
00:00:28,672 --> 00:00:30,442
(Sheldon:)You seem to be
headed somewhere.

11
00:00:30,507 --> 00:00:32,177
(Sheldon:)May I walk with you?

12
00:00:32,243 --> 00:00:34,243
(Amy:)Sure.

13
00:00:36,113 --> 00:00:38,753
(Sheldon:)Boy, I'm glad we're
going out again.

14
00:00:40,784 --> 00:00:41,984
(Amy:)We're not back together.

15
00:00:42,052 --> 00:00:43,052
(Leonard:)Why?

16
00:00:43,087 --> 00:00:44,217
(Sheldon:)Is there someone else?

17
00:00:44,288 --> 00:00:45,588
(Sheldon:)Just couldn't wait
for that first notch

18
00:00:45,655 --> 00:00:47,285
(Sheldon:)on your bedpost, could you?

19
00:00:47,357 --> 00:00:49,287
(Amy:)If you must know,

20
00:00:49,359 --> 00:00:50,789
(Amy:)I'm going to Howard
and Bernadette's

21
00:00:50,861 --> 00:00:52,231
(Amy:)to watch the wedding.

22
00:00:52,295 --> 00:00:53,325
(Sheldon:)And who's this guy
you're taking?

23
00:00:53,397 --> 00:00:54,427
There's no guy!

24
00:00:54,498 --> 00:00:55,928
(Sheldon:)Oh, you're going
to a wedding alone?

25
00:00:55,999 --> 00:00:57,699
(Sheldon:)That's sad.

26
00:00:57,768 --> 00:00:58,938
(Amy:)I'm not gonna be alone.

27
00:00:59,002 --> 00:01:00,272
(Amy:)I'll be with my friends.

28
00:01:00,336 --> 00:01:01,466
Your friends?

